                            <h2 class="title" id="overview_heading">Overview</h2>
                            <h2>From Data to Story: Helping a Non-Profit Explain Its Impact</h2>
<p>Tipping Point Community is an organization dedicated to fighting poverty—making it one among thousands competing for attention and funds. This unique foundation needed a story that would help it stand out from the crowd. We were eager to help them tell it.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
                        
                        

                        
                            <div class="mt-5">
                                <div id="hs_cos_wrapper_understand_heading" class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module" style="" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="module"><!-- module html  -->










<h4 class="module custom-heading" style="color: #FF4E00; border-color: #4A4A4A; border-width: 2px" data-number="1">Understand</h4>
</div>
                            </div>
                            <div>
<p>To begin, we reviewed a mass of data and impact reports, combining interviews and trends to help Tipping Point Community distill what makes it special, and tease out a story that would attract both funders and grantees.</p>
<p><img src="/hs-fs/hubfs/Imported_Blog_Media/1-1.5c625ee2.png" alt="Report Screenshot" width="636" loading="lazy" style="width: 636px;" srcset="/hs-fs/hubfs/Imported_Blog_Media/1-1.cedb8d1d.png 318w, /hs-fs/hubfs/Imported_Blog_Media/1-1.5c625ee2.png 636w, /hs-fs/hubfs/Imported_Blog_Media/1-1.551f721b.png 954w, /hs-fs/hubfs/Imported_Blog_Media/1-1.838e4b14.png 1272w, /hs-fs/hubfs/Imported_Blog_Media/1-1.e81a577d.png 1590w, /hs-fs/hubfs/Imported_Blog_Media/1-1.f845673d.png 1908w" sizes="(max-width: 636px) 100vw, 636px"></p>
</div>
                        


                        
                            <div class="mt-5">
                                <div id="hs_cos_wrapper_explore_heading" class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module" style="" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="module"><!-- module html  -->










<h4 class="module custom-heading align-right" style="color: #FF4E00; border-color: #4A4A4A; border-width: 2px" data-number="2">Explore</h4>
</div>
                            </div>
                            <div>
<p>Traditional annual reports leave much to be desired. For Tipping Point’s 10 Year Anniversary, we wanted to create a digital story as compelling as the work they do.</p>
<p><img src="/hs-fs/hubfs/Imported_Blog_Media/thumbnail-2.82ae2e87.jpg" alt="Green Chart" width="1216" loading="lazy" style="width: 1216px;" srcset="/hs-fs/hubfs/Imported_Blog_Media/thumbnail-2.e35c91b4.jpg 608w, /hs-fs/hubfs/Imported_Blog_Media/thumbnail-2.82ae2e87.jpg 1216w, /hs-fs/hubfs/Imported_Blog_Media/thumbnail-2.66695321.jpg 1824w, /hs-fs/hubfs/Imported_Blog_Media/thumbnail-2.ba3fbc5a.jpg 2432w, /hs-fs/hubfs/Imported_Blog_Media/thumbnail-2.edd57a7e.jpg 3040w, /hs-fs/hubfs/Imported_Blog_Media/thumbnail-2.d781ec98.jpg 3648w" sizes="(max-width: 1216px) 100vw, 1216px"></p>
</div>
                        


                        
                            <div class="mt-5">
                                <div id="hs_cos_wrapper_create_heading" class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module" style="" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="module"><!-- module html  -->










<h4 class="module custom-heading" style="color: #FF4E00; border-color: #4A4A4A; border-width: 2px" data-number="3">Create</h4>
</div>
                            </div>
                            <p><span>We saw a way to use the dual nature of giving—investing on the one hand, and the corresponding impact on the other—as a UX design framework that would inspire folks to engage with the report in unexpected ways. </span><span>In order to tell the story in more than words, we created a user interface and a user experience that speaks for itself.</span></p>
<p><span><img src="/hs-fs/hubfs/Imported_Blog_Media/3-1-1.cd29a490.png" alt="Report screenshot" width="636" loading="lazy" style="width: 636px;" srcset="/hs-fs/hubfs/Imported_Blog_Media/3-1-1.4be1f7f4.png 318w, /hs-fs/hubfs/Imported_Blog_Media/3-1-1.cd29a490.png 636w, /hs-fs/hubfs/Imported_Blog_Media/3-1-1.04c1d923.png 954w, /hs-fs/hubfs/Imported_Blog_Media/3-1-1.0bfdc10a.png 1272w, /hs-fs/hubfs/Imported_Blog_Media/3-1-1.d6a3a225.png 1590w, /hs-fs/hubfs/Imported_Blog_Media/3-1-1.735020bc.png 1908w" sizes="(max-width: 636px) 100vw, 636px"></span></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
                        


                        
                            <div class="mt-5">
                                <div id="hs_cos_wrapper_launch_heading" class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module" style="" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="module"><!-- module html  -->










<h4 class="module custom-heading align-right" style="color: #FF4E00; border-color: #4A4A4A; border-width: 2px" data-number="4">Launch</h4>
</div>
                            </div>
                            <div>
<p>Initial design work ultimately led to a highly interactive online experience, balancing data and metrics with real stories from the people whose lives have been affected by poverty—and by Tipping Point Community's incredible work. The organization’s uncommon grant-making philosophy and approach were highlighted with a unique interface which has allowed the report to make an incredible impact.</p>
<p><img src="/hs-fs/hubfs/Imported_Blog_Media/4-2-1.71b02dcf.png" alt="Report screenshot" width="636" loading="lazy" style="width: 636px;" srcset="/hs-fs/hubfs/Imported_Blog_Media/4-2-1.bce945a9.png 318w, /hs-fs/hubfs/Imported_Blog_Media/4-2-1.71b02dcf.png 636w, /hs-fs/hubfs/Imported_Blog_Media/4-2-1.eccaa579.png 954w, /hs-fs/hubfs/Imported_Blog_Media/4-2-1.c13b28e6.png 1272w, /hs-fs/hubfs/Imported_Blog_Media/4-2-1.c4a44d71.png 1590w, /hs-fs/hubfs/Imported_Blog_Media/4-2-1.2e43d270.png 1908w" sizes="(max-width: 636px) 100vw, 636px"></p>
<p><img src="/hs-fs/hubfs/Imported_Blog_Media/FInal-5.f0016e19.png" alt="FInal-5" width="1386" loading="lazy" style="width: 1386px;" srcset="/hs-fs/hubfs/Imported_Blog_Media/FInal-5.3c426796.png 693w, /hs-fs/hubfs/Imported_Blog_Media/FInal-5.f0016e19.png 1386w, /hs-fs/hubfs/Imported_Blog_Media/FInal-5.a5d50d3c.png 2079w, /hs-fs/hubfs/Imported_Blog_Media/FInal-5.56bd1eb5.png 2772w, /hs-fs/hubfs/Imported_Blog_Media/FInal-5.cc0fd8cf.png 3465w, /hs-fs/hubfs/Imported_Blog_Media/FInal-5.331c4161.png 4158w" sizes="(max-width: 1386px) 100vw, 1386px"></p>
<p><img src="/hs-fs/hubfs/Imported_Blog_Media/tp2.0f98e38a.gif" alt="tp2" width="1361" loading="lazy" style="width: 1361px;" srcset="/hs-fs/hubfs/Imported_Blog_Media/tp2.d7df1807.gif 681w, /hs-fs/hubfs/Imported_Blog_Media/tp2.0f98e38a.gif 1361w, /hs-fs/hubfs/Imported_Blog_Media/tp2.58e5ed5c.gif 2042w, /hs-fs/hubfs/Imported_Blog_Media/tp2.76a583b5.gif 2722w, /hs-fs/hubfs/Imported_Blog_Media/tp2.87c909a4.gif 3403w, /hs-fs/hubfs/Imported_Blog_Media/tp2.c2962e99.gif 4083w" sizes="(max-width: 1361px) 100vw, 1361px"></p>
<p><img src="/hs-fs/hubfs/Imported_Blog_Media/tipping-ipad-1.3a5e9687.jpg" alt="tipping-ipad-1" width="3224" loading="lazy" style="width: 3224px;" srcset="/hs-fs/hubfs/Imported_Blog_Media/tipping-ipad-1.9ebd7d0e.jpg 1612w, /hs-fs/hubfs/Imported_Blog_Media/tipping-ipad-1.3a5e9687.jpg 3224w, /hs-fs/hubfs/Imported_Blog_Media/tipping-ipad-1.cfd3f020.jpg 4836w, /hs-fs/hubfs/Imported_Blog_Media/tipping-ipad-1.e6a45de0.jpg 6448w, /hs-fs/hubfs/Imported_Blog_Media/tipping-ipad-1.2a71cf2e.jpg 8060w, /hs-fs/hubfs/Imported_Blog_Media/tipping-ipad-1.e6974fda.jpg 9672w" sizes="(max-width: 3224px) 100vw, 3224px"></p>
</div>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
                        

                        
                        
